The rings had nothing to do with it.  Whenever you are poly'd to
another form, whether by lycanthropy, ring, potion, spell, wand or
trap, if you then lose all your hit points you will return to human
form with full hit points. Unless you are wearing an amulet of
unchanging, in which case you will die.

You are still a lycanthrope, though, and you will continue to transform
at random until you become purified.  There are a few ways to do that.



